<title>UK: Goldman sets warrants on European bank basket.</title>
<headline>Goldman sets warrants on European bank basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on a basket of 20 European banks, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>The basket consists of shares of Deutsche Bank AG, Dresdner Bank AG, Commerzbank AG, Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG, Societe Generale, Banque Nationale de Paris, Credit Commercial de France, Banco Bilbao Vizcaya SA, Banco Santander SA, Argentaria Sa, Unidanmark AS, Credit Suisse Group, Swiss Bank Corp, Union Bank of Switzerland, ING Groep NV, ABN AMRO Holding NV, Cetelem SA, Kredietbank NV, Skandinaviska Eskilda Banken and Nordbanken.</p>
<p>One basket is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,000 DEM		 PREMIUM	10.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.03 DEM		  GEARING	9.71 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 26.FEB.97-10.FEB.99   PAYDATE	25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUES/FFT/STUT	   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,000 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
